// HCM — WS12 analytics (docs/hcm/analytics.md).
//
// No new models. This workstream is a read-only reporting layer over tables
// other workstreams already own — EmploymentRelationship, Assignment,
// LeaveBalance, WorkAttendance, PayrollInstruction, Application, Requisition,
// OvertimeAccrual, LearningRecord — plus, where they have landed, a handful
// of other workstreams' tables (compensation bands, engagement surveys, HR
// cases) read defensively so a metric this dashboard has no data for yet
// reports "not measured" instead of crashing the page. Computing and storing
// a second copy of any of that data here would just be one more place for it
// to go stale against the tables that actually own it.
